    "reading_order": 11,
    "text": "Here, the amount of money (in `) put in the money box on her first, second, third,\nfourth . . . birthday were respectively 100, 150, 200, 250, . . . till her 21st birthday. To\nfind the total amount in the money box on her 21st birthday, we will have to write each\nof the 21 numbers in the list above and then add them up. Don’t you think it would be\na tedious and time consuming process? Can we make the process shorter? This would\nbe possible if we can find a method for getting this sum. Let us see.",
    "latex": null,
    "image_ref": null,
    "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
